WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
Every file server on your network.
Found, mapped and managed from one browser tab.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:09.154
Scan your network
Every SMB server, by name.

00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:18.123
Map a share in seconds
No drivers. No setup on the NAS.

00:00:18.123 --> 00:00:21.423
Select like Finder
Drag, Shift-click, ⌘-click.

00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:24.337
Right-click everything

00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:29.776
Copy to the cloud
The server moves the bytes.

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:39.008
Mount it as a drive
Any app. Any file size.

00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:41.096
Favourites that stick

00:00:41.096 --> 00:00:55.424
Huge folders, in easy parts

00:00:55.424 --> 00:01:01.192
Script it
Every feature has a CLI command.

00:01:01.192 --> 00:01:07.560
Build it into your app
One element. No passwords stored.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:12.060
